  "_comment": "Declarative agent-connector-sdk mcp_tool presets (RF-ADR-009 2.2.1). 'server' is a placeholder the fleet registry derives at manifest-generation time; do not hand-edit connector_manifest.yml from this file directly. 'ontology_class' targets are PROVISIONAL -- see ontology/mappings/source.yaml: EG's finance-v1 ontology (feat/finance-core) has not published class names as of this package's build.",
